      "is": "IS 3337:1978",
      "clause": "3",
      "title": "Manafacture",
      "text": "3. Manafacture — Bark shall be completely removed and all the branches and excrescences shall be dressed down flush with the surface. The top and bottom ends shall be cut square.",
