      "clause": "4",
      "title": "Dimensions",
      "text": "4. Dimensions— BALLIES shall conform to the dimensions given below; unless otherwise ordered. Class of Diameter at Diameter at Length Ballies the Top the Butt End cm cm m 1 Over 8.5 upto 12.5 Over 15    upto 20 3 to 9 2 Over 6.5 upto 8.5 Over 11.5 upto 15 3 to 9 3 Over 5     upto 6.5 Over    7.5 upto 11.5     3 to 9",
      "clause_id": "IS 3337:1978#4",
