    {
      "is": "IS 3337:1978",
      "clause": "8",
      "title": "Preservation",
      "text": "8. Preservation — Whenever required shall be preserved by dipping, brushing or spraying with any one of the following composiions: a)   Creosote — fuel oil mixture 50:50, b)   6 percent solution of copper-arsenic composition, c)   6 percent solution of acid-cupric-chromate   composition, d)   8 percent solution of copper- chrome-boric  composition, and e)   1.0 percent solution of sodium pentachlorophenate.",
